# `terraform output -json` (scripts/export-terraform-outputs.sh) does
# NOT mask `sensitive = true` outputs the way plain `terraform output`
# does -- every IAM access-key/secret-key output this project has
# lands here in plaintext. Meant to be generated locally, read by
# airflow/config/bootstrap/terraform.py at container-bootstrap time,
# never committed -- found live, 2026-08-10 (see
# docs/architecture/roadmap-next-steps.md): the export script was
# broken (a path bug) from before this project added any sensitive
# outputs, which meant it silently never got re-run since, so this
# never surfaced until fixing the script made it runnable again.
airflow/config/terraform_outputs.json


